.description
RK8E Drive Control Test

This .dg version has this patch incorrectly applied:
0741: 7301 CLA CLL IAC	!= 4453 CLRALL
0742: 4453 CLRALL	!= 1157 TAD STCON/0157
0743: 3143 DCA GDREG2	!= 4774 JMS I 0774
0744: 4444 RDSTAT	== 4444 RDSTAT
0745: 7640 SZA CLA	!= 7610 SKP CLA
0774: XXXX 		!= 1370 ????
1370: XXXX		!= 0000 .-.
1371: XXXX		!= 3143 DCA GDREG2
1372: XXXX		!= 4444 RDSTAT
1373: XXXX		!= 5770 JMP I .-3
In particular, location 0774 points to location
6003 instead of location 1370. As a result, the
diagnostic crashes during test 13.
